# Testing Honeypots

## 1. Test Cowrie (SSH Honeypot)

Connect to the SSH honeypot:

```bash
ssh root@localhost -p 22
```

After connection, try attacker-like commands:

```bash
ls
pwd
whoami
uname -a
cat /etc/passwd
```

The commands are recorded as attacker activity.

View logs:

```bash
cat cowrie/data/log/cowrie.json
```

---

# 2. Test Dionaea (FTP Honeypot)

Connect:

```bash
ftp localhost
```

Try authentication:

```text
Username:
admin

Password:
admin
```

The login attempt will be captured by Dionaea.

View logs:

```bash
cat dionaea/data/log/dionaea.json
```

---

# 3. Test Tanner + Snare (HTTP Honeypot)

Open browser:

```text
http://localhost
```

or test using curl:

```bash
curl -i http://localhost
```

Suspicious HTTP requests are captured by Snare and analyzed by Tanner.

View logs:

```bash
cat tanner/data/tanner_report.json
```

